# Wallust generated files
# The generated color files (and hyprlock's wallpaper path) are tracked on
# purpose, with the default colors, so a fresh install works before any
# wallpaper is set: Hyprland finds colors/colors.lua, the lock screen and foot
# find their color files, and hyprlock shows a blurred screenshot as background.
# wallust and wallpaper.sh overwrite them in ~/.config when you set a wallpaper.
